Perhatikan kode berikut:
class Parent {
  greet() { return 'Halo dari Parent'; }
}
class Child extends Parent {
  greet() {
    return super.greet() + ' dan Child';
  }
}
const c = new Child();
console.log(c.greet());
Prinsip OOP apa yang didemonstrasikan kode tersebut?

Apa output dari pengecekan private field menggunakan keyword 'in' berikut (ES2022):
class Account {
  #pin = 1234;
  static check(obj) { return #pin in obj; }
}
console.log(Account.check(new Account()), Account.check({}));

Perhatikan kode berikut:
class Counter {
  #count = 0;
  get count() { return this.#count; }
  set count(val) { if (val >= 0) this.#count = val; }
}
const c = new Counter();
c.count = -5;
console.log(c.count);
Berapa nilai yang tercetak?

Perhatikan kode polymorphism berikut:
class Shape { area() { return 0; } }
class Circle extends Shape { constructor(r) { super(); this.r = r; } area() { return Math.PI * this.r ** 2; } }
class Square extends Shape { constructor(s) { super(); this.s = s; } area() { return this.s ** 2; } }
function totalArea(shapes) { return shapes.reduce((sum, s) => sum + s.area(), 0); }
Apa peran polymorphism dalam fungsi totalArea?
